# ===============================================================
# 全局：先忽略所有，仅保留配置文件
# ===============================================================
*
!.gitignore

# ===============================================================
# 模块：ME (机械工程) - 全量放行
# ===============================================================
!ME/
!ME/**

# ===============================================================
# 模块：AI-ML-DL-RL (人工智能) - 精准放行
# ===============================================================
!AI-ML-DL-RL/
AI-ML-DL-RL/*
!AI-ML-DL-RL/GPU-DEEPLEARNING/
!AI-ML-DL-RL/GPU-DEEPLEARNING/**
!AI-ML-DL-RL/DL/
!AI-ML-DL-RL/DL/**
!AI-ML-DL-RL/TOPICS/
!AI-ML-DL-RL/TOPICS/**
!AI-ML-DL-RL/ROS2/
AI-ML-DL-RL/ROS2/*
!AI-ML-DL-RL/ROS2/Notes/
!AI-ML-DL-RL/ROS2/Notes/**

# ===============================================================
# 模块：CodingBasics (编程基础) - 精准放行
# ===============================================================
!CodingBasics/
CodingBasics/*
!CodingBasics/Cpp/
!CodingBasics/Cpp/**
!CodingBasics/Leetcode_Notes/
!CodingBasics/Leetcode_Notes/**
!CodingBasics/git.md
!!CodingBasics/puedocode.md

# ===============================================================
# 模块：ROBOTICS (机器人学) - 递归放行 (排除 Kurs 编译项)
# ===============================================================
!ROBOTICS/
ROBOTICS/*
!ROBOTICS/robotics/
!ROBOTICS/robotics/**
!ROBOTICS/REINFORCEMENT_LEARNING/
!ROBOTICS/REINFORCEMENT_LEARNING/**
!ROBOTICS/ROS2/
ROBOTICS/ROS2/*
!ROBOTICS/ROS2/Notes/
!ROBOTICS/ROS2/Notes/**

# ===============================================================
# 自动屏蔽：禁止所有路径下的开发缓存与编译产物
# ===============================================================
# 即使在上述放行的文件夹内，只要匹配以下规则也一律屏蔽
**/.accelerate/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.idea/
**/.vscode/
**/.obsidian/
**/build/
**/install/
**/log/
**/.DS_Store